 "remarks": "The Best of Downtown Stamford Living! Just renovated!! Enjoy a carefree life in this terrific 2 BR, 2.5 Bath, 1470 sq ft end unit townhome. Features include a white, eat-in kitchen with new stove and microwave, powder room, spacious and open LR/DR with fireplace and sliders to deck. Upstairs has large Primary BR with balcony and renovated bath, second BR and updated bath, laundry and attic storage. Brand new HVAC, garage space and additional spaces in front. Exciting CITY VIEWS, yet on a quiet street in the heard of downtown. Unbeatable, car-optional location - walk to the many amazing restaurants, shopping, theaters, library and gyms nearby. Close to train, highways and beaches. Solid investment - strong rental history and low taxes and common charges. Shows great - A perfect choice!",
